# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add` — developer-local tooling, like
# .vscode/ above. The skill files are third-party content vendored into the
# working copy by the installer, not source for this project. skills-lock.json
# is ignored too: pinning these skills for everyone is a team decision nobody
# has made, and the lockfile alone would pin skills the repo does not carry.
.agents/
.claude/
agent/
skills-lock.json
